  "_comment": "UnboundBot — Alpaca PAPER execution config (Phase 6). WIRED BUT NOT EXERCISED: current keys return 401 (Phase0_Audit sec.4). dry_run=false means Freqtrade sends REAL orders to the endpoint below; the trader URL is overridden to paper-api.alpaca.markets so orders go to Alpaca PAPER (no real money). Do NOT run until check_alpaca.py reports AUTH OK and the owner approves paper order flow.",
